paragraph('41_ch09','In this chapter we treat a graphic',r'''In this chapter we revise category charts, draw regression estimates with their intervals, and annotate a trend at the date of a program change. We also write captions and plan related figures together. The examples in \texttt{ch09\_graphs.do} use the built-in \texttt{nlsw88} data and a simulated time series, so you can adapt the code while checking how each design choice affects what the reader can compare.''','Remove long marketing preview; correct all-examples nlsw claim.')
